cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or cartography in academic work, please cite as:"
title: "observatoire[s]·ia · Cartographie indépendante des observatoires emploi & IA"
abstract: >
  A bilingual (FR/EN) cartography of public observatories tracking the
  impact of artificial intelligence on employment in Switzerland and
  France. Aggregates 14 observatories, 524 occupations (200 FR ROME +
  324 CH NP 2010), 25 prospective indicators, 28 milestones 2019-2026,
  and 30 referenced economists. Released under CC BY 4.0.
